title: config:reload
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Customising the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Re-read user configuration without a restart (keybindings / style / grammar / commands / all)

Reads a part of the configuration again while the GUI runs, and reports what was reloaded in the status bar. A malformed file is refused and what was in effect stays. See [[Reloading the configuration]], which also says what needs a restart.
